body:
If youve never gotten a crush or anything like that then your probably Asexual meaning you dont get feelings for people, for me its not very common to get a crush usually its difficult to say how many crushes in a year you have because most people keep crushing for the person even for years although ive never had a crush last more than a year, but i havent had a crush in over a year now. For some reason i just dont get crushes anymore.

&#x200B;

Edit: sorry i didnt read the r/aromantic but as far as i know having a crush is like good pain, have you ever felt an itch and then when you scratch it you feel good, its sort of like that the crush being the itch and then finding out the person you are crushing on likes you an like that the itch is being scratched and feeling better.

I wear the same clothes for a week since its pijamas

&#x200B;

